<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod rises 2.2 pct June yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod rises 2.2 pct June yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production rose 2.2 percent year-on-year in June, while month-on-month it rose 1.7 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					  Jun 96	May 96	Jun 95</p>
<p>General Index			 103.9	 102.1	 101.7</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	    +2.2	  0.0</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	    +1.7	 +3.4</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months		+2.3	 +2.4</p>
<p>Base Year = 1985</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
